00:32:53.000 --> 00:33:17.000
and an area in which I'm extremely excited is thinking about the ways in which our perceptions of people extend beyond their bodies and their faces and the things that we are all actively doing in any moment, and rather the way they get sort of translated or transmuted, perhaps more appropriately, into the things with which we interact. And so there's been some work that was done
